{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Hanya perkiraan. Model inti-udara menggunakan pendekatan lapisan tunggal Wheeler dan merupakan panduan kasar apabila diameter lilitan kurang daripada panjang lilitan ZXQPH0000QXZ×. Ia melewatkan ketebalan wayar, jarak, logam berdekatan, frekuensi, kapasitans parasit dan keadaan pengukuran. Untuk toroid, masukkan faktor AL dari lembaran data inti tepatnya; AL dan kebolehpercayaan boleh berubah dengan frekuensi, suhu, bias DC, jurang dan toleransi pembuatan. Sahkan sebarang reka bentuk sebenar dengan pengeluar dan pengukuran inti.","record_id":"801721ff3d75c57a68857a84752056cb8f99905fe832d31d347a99466d938242","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.5466400863750778,"source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00215a9916e516e2d603237c8159","status":"needs-review","translation":"Hanya perkiraan. Model inti-udara menggunakan pendekatan lapisan tunggal Wheeler dan merupakan panduan kasar apabila diameter lilitan kurang daripada panjang lilitan 3×. Ia melewatkan ketebalan wayar, jarak, logam berdekatan, frekuensi, kapasitans parasit dan keadaan pengukuran. Untuk toroid, masukkan faktor AL dari lembaran data inti tepatnya; AL dan kebolehpercayaan boleh berubah dengan frekuensi, suhu, bias DC, jurang dan toleransi pembuatan. Sahkan sebarang reka bentuk sebenar dengan pengeluar dan pengukuran inti.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
